"of anchor tags), and a user clicks the link, a download will start in "
"FrostWire."
msgstr ""
"Magnet links allow users to download files through FrostWire from a web "
"page. When you put a magnet link on your web page (in the 'href' attribute "
"of anchor tags), and a user clicks the link, a download will start in "
"FrostWire."

